;Author stated: 
9-hydroxyoctadecanoic acid (PubChem CID: 9570127 DL-9-hydroxy stearic acid) is a hydroxyoctadecanoic acid that is octadecanoic acid (stearic acid) which has been substituted by a hydroxy group at position 9. It is a conjugate acid of a 9-hydroxyoctadecanoate.
